flowchart LR
    Plan[SearchPlan in stable order] --> You[You.com attempts]
    You --> Extract{Deterministic discovery checks}
    Extract -->|supported| Prospective[Prospective Supervisor + exact provenance]
    Extract -->|excluded| Taxonomy[Five fixed rejection counts]

    You --> Yield[Latest current-round plausible count per query]
    Yield --> Priority[Sort descending yield then original plan order]
    Priority --> Tavily[Tavily fallback: existing four-call budget]
    Tavily --> Extract

    Prospective --> Dedupe[Deterministic deduplication]
    Dedupe --> Gate{At least five unique?}
    Gate -->|yes| Evidence[Existing evidence workflow]
    Gate -->|no, budget exhausted| Stop[Recoverable discovery_incomplete]

    Taxonomy --> Attempt[Typed SearchAttempt]
    Attempt --> UI[Streamlit aggregate diagnostics]
    Attempt --> Trace[LangSmith empty-payload span metadata]

    classDef external fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#245a9b;
    class You,Tavily,Trace external;
    classDef unchanged fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#666,stroke-dasharray: 4 3;
    class Gate,Evidence,Stop unchanged;
